# Everything here is checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Windows clones default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites kit/serve.sh to
# CRLF. It is COPYed into the image and executed, so its shebang becomes
# "#!/usr/bin/env bash\r" and the sandbox fails to start with no log and no
# obvious error. The Dockerfile also strips CR defensively, but do not rely on
# that alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The vendored trees under repos/ are reference material, not this project's
# code, so GitHub's language statistics must not count them.
repos/** linguist-vendored
